Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This program links against the `windmill-parser` and `windmill-parser-sql`
crates from Windmill:

    Copyright (c) 2022 Windmill Labs, Inc
    https://github.com/windmill-labs/windmill
    (paths `backend/parsers/windmill-parser` and
     `backend/parsers/windmill-parser-sql`)
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

Windmill's top-level LICENSE states that "the files under backend/ are AGPLv3
Licensed, except any snippets of code under the compile flag 'enterprise'".
The two parser crates used here contain no `enterprise`-gated code, so they are
AGPLv3 in full. Because sqlsig links them, sqlsig as a whole is distributed
under the AGPLv3 as well.

These crates are consumed as pinned git dependencies rather than being copied
into this repository; see Cargo.toml for the pinned revision.
